  "summary": "整篇形式证明尚未通过 Lean Kernel；请查看原稿锚点、编译诊断和翻译缺口，不能据此判定原数学证明错误。",
  "sourceSteps": [
    {
      "id": "source-0",
      "index": 0,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 149,
      "end": 275,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第一步：记 F(t)=t²+t+1，e=2025。只要选择 u_2 为正整数，给定 u_1=1 后，有理数递推便唯一确定全部后项；因此需找出恰好哪些 u_2 能使后项全为正整数。注意 F(t)>0 对正数 t 成立，所以只要各次除法合法，所有后项为正。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_0",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-1",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 276,
      "end": 460,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第二步：由 u_1=1，u_3=F(u_2)^e。按模 u_2 计算，F(u_2)≡1，所以 u_3≡1 (mod u_2)。因为 u_4=F(u_3)^e/u_2 应为整数，所以 u_2 整除 F(u_3)^e≡F(1)^e=3^e (mod u_2)。于是 u_2|3^2025。正因子恰好为 1,3,3²,…,3^2025，共 2026 个，给出可能解数的上界。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_1",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-2",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 461,
      "end": 682,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第三步：反过来，任取 u_2=3^j（0≤j≤2025），按原递推逐项定义正有理数 u_n。u_3=F(u_2)^e 是整数；第二步同余计算给出 u_2|F(u_3)^e，故 u_4 也是整数。此时 gcd(u_2,u_3)=1，因为 u_3≡1 (mod u_2)；并且 gcd(u_3,u_4)=1，由 u_4u_2=F(u_3)^e≡1 (mod u_3) 得 gcd(u_3,u_2)=1，再结合连续递推，后续相邻项互素性可归纳维护。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_2",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-3",
      "index": 3,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 683,
      "end": 988,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第四步：给出归纳核心。设 n≥4，已知到 u_n 为止全为正整数，且连续的相邻项互素。记 b=u_{n−2}, c=u_{n−1}, d=u_n。递推给出 bd=F(c)^e，因此 bd≡1 (mod c)。此外 c u_{n−3}=F(b)^e，所以 F(b)^e≡0 (mod c)。由代数恒等式\nb²F(d)=(bd)²+b(bd)+b²≡1+b+b²=F(b) (mod c)，\n两侧取 e 次幂，得到 b^{2e}F(d)^e≡F(b)^e≡0 (mod c)。又 gcd(b,c)=1，因此 b^{2e} 在模 c 下可逆，推出 c|F(d)^e。所以 u_{n+1}=F(d)^e/c 是正整数。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_3",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-4",
      "index": 4,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 989,
      "end": 1155,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第五步：维护归纳所需互素性。由 u_{n+1}c=F(d)^e≡1 (mod d)，得 gcd(u_{n+1},d)=1。初始相邻项的互素性可由 u_3≡1 (mod u_2)、u_4u_2=F(u_3)^e≡1 (mod u_3) 与 gcd(u_2,u_3)=1 推出。于是用强归纳法所有 u_n 都是正整数，而且相邻两项互素。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_4",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-5",
      "index": 5,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 1156,
      "end": 1237,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第六步：因此每一个 3^j（j=0,…,2025）都给出一列符合要求的正整数数列。不同 u_2 确定不同数列，且其他 u_2 无法成立。答案恰好为 2026 列。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_5",
      "dependsOn": []
    }
  ],
